Note = {2nd International Conference on Social Sciences and Humanities (SOSHUM),
   Jakarta, INDONESIA, DEC 12-14, 2017},
Organization = {Malaysia Tech Scientist Assoc},
Abstract = {Rating and review are the most important trigger in ability and
   installation of applications (apps). Review about effectivity,
   efficiency, and satisfaction in usability becomes critical factors in
   assessing application's success or failure. In addition, the presence of
   Internet converges all types of media which have different
   characteristic. The media characteristics such as audio, audiovisual,
   dan visual text could be integrated into a single medium of new media.
   Consequently, conventional media measurement is no longer compatible
   with this new media. In case of Prambors radio, the radio now can be
   accessed through conventional radio and live streaming, either by mobile
   apps or website. Unfortunately, there is no any previous research on the
   audience's perception of radio apps including Prambors radio apps.
   Hence, this study proposes to develop a construct about user
   appreciation of converged media with the case of Prambors radio mobile
   apps in Indonesia. By using content analysis, this study also proposes
   an elaborated measurement based on user's appreciation toward converged
   new media.},
