   European Commiss Hong Kong \& Macao; CSR Asia},
Abstract = {Circular economy is carried out in China in order to settle the
   environmental and ecological problems resulting from the fast economic
   development. However, most ideas at present only stay in the paperwork
   like long term plan from the government; there are a few successful
   cases in practice. This paper displays a new theory to explain why some
   substances are easier to be reused or recycled but others are not based
   on 3 presumptions of a modem manufacturing process. Conclusions that
   higher Homogeneity and simpler processing tree are more possible to
   build up a circular chain is reached. A case study is provided to
   support the theoretical hypothesis.},
